<title>SINGAPORE: Courts full year net profit up 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Courts full year net profit up 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 13.37   vs    13.05</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)    12.47   vs    12.17</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	7.75   vs     7.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		  156.31   vs   122.40</p>
<p>    Other income		0.35   vs     0.12</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  0.06   vs     0.33</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   18.78   vs    17.64</p>
<p>    Tax			   5.41   vs     4.59</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: August 25 1997</p>
</text>
